efore, we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{S}\\,x & ={\\text{proj}}_{{a}_{1}}x+{\\text{proj}}_{{a}_{2}}x \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]+2[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]=\\overset{^}{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the distance between $x$ and the subspace $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d(x,\\overset{^}{x}) & =‖x-\\overset{^}{x}‖ \\\\  & =\\sqrt{({x}_{1}-{\\overset{^}{x}}_{1})^{2}+({x}_{2}-{\\overset{^}{x}}_{2})^{2}+({x}_{3}-{\\overset{^}{x}}_{3})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(4-3)^{2}+(0-2)^{2}+(2-1)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535227 true] [17592186338654 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338655 13194139535227 true] [17592186338654 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338656 13194139535227 true] [17592186338654 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338657 13194139535227 true] [17592186338654 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338658 13194139535227 true] [17592186338654 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338659 13194139535227 true] [17592186338654 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535227 true] [17592186338654 1041 "selection" 13194139535227 true] [17592186338654 1104 #edb/ref 17592186338657 13194139535227 true] [17592186338654 1110 #uuid "29bac39c-2279-56b2-8d8b-7db03c633d5a" 13194139535227 true] [17592186338655 1034 "\\sqrt{2}" 13194139535227 true] [17592186338655 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535227 true] [17592186338655 1111 #uuid "e595d57e-8f1b-5271-bc11-08cdd9d7e40f" 13194139535227 true] [17592186338656 1034 "\\sqrt{3}" 13194139535227 true] [17592186338656 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535227 true] [17592186338656 1111 #uuid "aa8bfcc2-456b-5789-b5a8-2d2cd146ed1a" 13194139535227 true] [17592186338657 1034 "\\sqrt{6}" 13194139535227 true] [17592186338657 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535227 true] [17592186338657 1111 #uuid "0fd62cda-5f9e-59f1-a322-df83c95ecaa9" 13194139535227 true] [17592186338658 1034 "3$\\sqrt{2}$" 13194139535227 true] [17592186338658 1103 #edb/ref 