gin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{S}\\,x & ={\\text{proj}}_{{a}_{1}}x+{\\text{proj}}_{{a}_{2}}x \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]=\\overset{^}{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the distance between $x$ and the subspace $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d(x,\\overset{^}{x}) & =‖x-\\overset{^}{x}‖ \\\\  & =\\sqrt{({x}_{1}-{\\overset{^}{x}}_{1})^{2}+({x}_{2}-{\\overset{^}{x}}_{2})^{2}+({x}_{3}-{\\overset{^}{x}}_{3})^{2}+({x}_{4}-{\\overset{^}{x}}_{4})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(2-3)^{2}+(3-3)^{2}+(-5-(-3))^{2}+(2-3)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535227 true] [17592186338661 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338662 13194139535227 true] [17592186338661 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338663 13194139535227 true] [17592186338661 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338664 13194139535227 true] [17592186338661 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338665 13194139535227 true] [17592186338661 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338666 13194139535227 true] [17592186338661 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535227 true] [17592186338661 1041 "selection" 13194139535227 true] [17592186338661 1104 #edb/ref 17592186338665 13194139535227 true] [17592186338661 1110 #uuid "0f6762de-bb82-50a8-9ef8-94b7cca9dd5e" 13194139535227 true] [17592186338662 1034 "2\\sqrt{3}" 13194139535227 true] [17592186338662 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535227 true] [17592186338662 1111 #uuid "860c2c98-1473-5976-944c-b03de3aca131" 13194139535227 true] [17592186338663 1034 "\\sqrt{2}" 13194139535227 true] [17592186338663 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535227 true] [17592186338663 1111 #uuid "435cc04a-0e20-5543-b697-bab4ca218714" 13194139535227 true] [17592186338664 1034 "\\sqrt{3}" 13194139535227 true] [17592186338664 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535227 true] [17592186338664 1111 #uuid "f6021ad0-530d-5bea-b8ab-492e6b5d46bb" 13194139535227 true] [17592186338665 1034 "\\sqrt{6}" 13194139535